Basic Steps to Push Changes to Github 
1. Make  Changes to File(s) 
2. Add Files to Git --> git add "FileName"
3. Commit Changes --> git commit -m"CommitName" 

Optional. View Files Present --> git ls-files
Optional. View Commit History --> git log --oneline 

4. Push Changes to Github --> git push -u origin master/main  



